          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot owaco bot Moses ki Aron ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jo Icrael gibiguro kemagi ŋat acel acel i te benderane, kun gitye ki lanyut me odi pa kwarogi; gibiguro kemagi kun doggi tiko kema me rwatte tuŋŋi ki tuŋŋi ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo ma biguro kemagi yo tuŋ wokceŋ, ka ma ceŋ tuc ki iye-ni, gibibedo jo ma i te bendera pa Juda, kun gilubo buca monygi; latel wi jo pa Juda aye Nakucon ma wod pa Aminadab, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma gikwano wel dano ma i buca monnye oromo alip pyerabiro wiye aŋwen, ki miya abicel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo ma biguro kemagi ma cok kwede gibibedo kaka pa Icakar; latel wi jo pa Icakar aye Natanel ma wod pa Jura, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma gikwano wel dano ma i buca monnye oromo alip pyerabic wiye aŋwen ki miya aŋwen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok kaka pa Jabulon; latel wi jo pa Jabulon aye Eliab ma wod pa Kelon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma gikwano wel dano ma i buca monnye oromo alip pyerabic wiye abiro, ki miya aŋwen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wel jo ducu ma i gony pa Juda, i bucagi, oromo alip miya acel ki pyeraboro wiye aŋwen, ki miya aŋwen. Ka wot ocakke, gin aye gibitelo yo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
