          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ki yo tuŋ acuc en aye bendera me gony pa jo pa Reuben bicuŋ iye, kun gilubo buca monygi; latel wi jo pa Reuben aye Elijur ma wod pa Cedeur, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma gikwano Wel dano ma i buca monnye oromo alip pyeraŋwen wiye abicel, ki miya abic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo ma biguro kemagi ma cok kwede gibibedo kaka pa Cimeon; latel wi jo pa Cimeon aye Celumiel ma wod pa Juricadai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma gikwano Wel dano ma i buca monnye oromo alip pyerabic wiye aboŋwen ki miya adek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok kaka pa Gad; latel wi jo pa Gad aye Eliacap wod pa Reuel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma gikwano wel dano ma i buca monnye oromo alip pyeraŋwen wiye abic, ki miya abicel ki pyerabic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wel jo ducu ma i gony pa Reuben, i bucagi, oromo alip miya acel ki pyerabic wiye acel, ki miya aŋwen ki pyerabic. Ka wot cakke, gin aye gibimol me aryone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
