          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wel jo ducu ma i gony pa Dan oromo alip miya acel ki pyerabic wiye abiro, ki miya abicel. Gin gibimol me agikkine, kun gilubbe aluba bendera ki bendera.”",
          "type": "text",
